WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
The grid fails at midnight.
Mika holds the medical case and looks up at the dark towers.

00:02.500 --> 00:04.300
Mika runs up the dark stairwell with her flashlight.

00:04.300 --> 00:07.550
On floor forty she collapses. A neighbor hands her water.

00:07.550 --> 00:11.100
Doors open on every landing. A small bird of light flies ahead.

00:11.100 --> 00:14.500
Neighbors pass the case hand to hand up the stairs.

00:14.500 --> 00:18.000
At sunrise the case reaches Mrs. Ito.
The bird of light fades on the windowsill.
